  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đúng.<br>Áp dụng quy tắc hình bình hành, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>,<br>và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Sai.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là hai véc-tơ đối nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> không cùng phương nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>≠</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
